          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At MatMov, an NGO supporting public school students, I have volunteered as a sociocultural studies teacher since January 2026. I teach online classes every other week on current affairs, critical thinking and life planning. I have taught "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "50+ students",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", with "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "16–25 students",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " per class."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "i18nId": "contribution"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I prepare lessons and slides, grade assignments and support students. I also helped plan the Construindo Sonhos (Building Dreams) workshop, with around "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "50 participants",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", share materials with fellow teachers and organized the OneDrive folders."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
