          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I conceived and founded Jornal SESI 222 with support from the school library to share school events and achievements with students, families and staff. The idea began in July 2025, and the first issue was completed and distributed in 2026. The newspaper has "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "1 published issue",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", with "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "10 contributors",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", including me."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "i18nId": "contribution"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I selected topics with the librarian, wrote articles, revised texts with Portuguese teachers and designed the issue in Canva. I also adapted images to school guidelines and helped arrange distribution through the school’s official communication platform."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
